# Single build output root, shared by both harnesses:
#   out\<Platform>\<Configuration>\            exes + staged runtime DLLs
#   out\<Platform>\<Configuration>\obj\<Proj>\ intermediates
# Pinned in each .vcxproj, and named by run_all.ps1. Replaces the private
# x64\<Config>\ each harness had while it was a directory of its own.
#
# MixConTestAuth provisions its identity and agreement keys into p2p\ BESIDE
# ITS EXECUTABLE, resolved from GetModuleFileName -- so they land under out\
# and are ignored with it. That is deliberate and not incidental: a private key
# is machine-scoped DPAPI material, it is useless anywhere else, and it must
# never be committed. Delete out\ to re-provision from scratch.
out/

logs/
.vs/
*.user
